- Everything under thirdparty/ (rexglue-sdk, plume, XenosRecomp, miniz, zstd,
  renderdoc) is under its own license, in its LICENSE file or source headers.

This repository contains nothing from Project Sylpheed: no game data, no code
recompiled from its executable and no shaders extracted from it. Those are
generated from the user's own copy at build time and are never committed. The
game's code, shaders and assets belong to their owners and are not covered by
any license here.
